##############################
### Separatist Ship Models ###
##############################


#	Model					Section												Built-In Locators

#	Seathipede Shuttle		-	Science Ship										-	Engines
#	C9979				-	Transport Ship										-	Engines + Explosions
#	Salvage Freighter		-	Construction Ship									-	Engines + Explosions
#	Trafed II			-	Colony Ship										-	Engines + Explosions
#	Saboath Deployer		-	Add-On Corvette M1S1 01									-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Hammer Picket			-	Add-On Corvette PD2S1									-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	BC-714				-	Corvette S3 + Corvette M1S1								-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Hardcell			-	Add-On Corvette M1S1 02									-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Patrol Frigate			-	Destroyer Bow S3									-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Diamond Cruiser			-	Destroyer Bow M1S2									-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Lupus				-	Destroyer Bow L1									-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Wavecrest			-	Exploration Cruiser Bow M2 + Exploration Cruiser Bow M1S2 + Exploration Cruiser Bow L1	-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Technounion Frigate		-	Cruiser Mid M3										-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Munificent			-	Cruiser Mid L1M1									-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Captor				-	Cruiser Mid S2HB + Cruiser Mid M2S2							-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Recusant			-	Battlecruiser Bow L1									-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Recusant (Scout Destroyer)	-	Battlecruiser Bow M2S2									-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Saboath Destroyer		-	Battlecruiser Bow M3									-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Providence			-	Dreadnought Bow L1M1S2 + Dreadnought Bow L2						-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Providence (Invisible Hand)	-	Dreadnought Bow M1S2SHB + Dreadnought Bow XL1						-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Bulwark				-	Battleship Mid L3 + Battleship Mid M4SHB						-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Lucrehulk			-	Carrier Bow L1M1S2 + Carrier Bow L2 + Carrier Bow M1S2SHB + Carrier Bow XL1		-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Supply Ship			-	Battleship Mid L2M2 + Battleship Mid S4LHB						-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions (& Detonate)
#	Providence Dreadnought		-	Titan Mid + Juggernaut + Coloussus							-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions (& Detonate)
#	Subjugator			-	Flagship Bow L1M1S2 + Flagship Bow L2 + Flagship Bow M1S2SHB + Flagship Bow XL1		-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions (& Detonate)


